{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7a8b-9c0d-smartretail01",
    "name": "SmartRetail API Documentation",
    "description": "# Smart Retail API - Automated Supermarket System\n\nThis API provides secure authentication, authorization, and store management for the **Smart Retail** platform.\n\n### Roles Overview\n- **SuperAdmin**: The system platform owner who manages the software, monitors users, and controls platform access.\n- **Owner**: Supermarket/store owner who registers to the system, owns stores, and manages smart devices.\n\n### Authentication Flow\n1. Register via `POST /api/accounts/register` (Account is assigned role **Owner** with inactive status).\n2. Request activation OTP via `POST /api/accounts/account-activations`.\n3. Verify OTP via `POST /api/accounts/account-activations/verify`.\n4. Login via `POST /api/accounts/login` to obtain JWT Bearer Token and Refresh Token.\n5. Use the Bearer Token in `Authorization: Bearer <token>` for protected endpoints.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication & Registration",
      "description": "Endpoints available for guests to register, activate accounts, and login.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Owner Account",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"new_owner@smartretail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"P@ssword123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/accounts/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "accounts",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registers a new store owner account. Automatically assigns the `Owner` role. Sends an activation email with OTP code."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send Account Activation Code",
          "request": {
